# Local-only agent tooling, deliberately untracked:
# - `.claude/` is per-machine assistant configuration.
# - `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` are generated by `npx gitnexus analyze`
#   and rewritten on every run, so tracking them would put churn in every
#   diff for content that's reproducible from the repo itself.
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
